吹，晨光无限暖大地。宁王府废物凰冷月高攀魅国公连城魅，简直是西川的重磅新闻。可是这重磅新闻还没传开，就听到魅国公连城魅洞房花烛夜到了青，楼去喝酒，彻夜未归。一大早，连城家总管连城峰满脸得意洋洋的来给九夫人请安。与其是请安，不如说是来看笑话的，不知道那个废物新婚夜守空房的感觉，是不是很爽啊！连城魅此前已有八房夫人，凰冷月排名第九。可当连城峰带一众家丁到风轻阁时，个个儿都瞪大了眼睛。瞧他们看见了什么？他们竟然看见传说中的废柴竟脚踏两名家丁，正优哉悠哉地站在阁前。那两名家丁不是别人，正是护国公跟前得宠的红人。连城峰狠狠一甩头，不，他没有产生幻觉，那个废物竟然卸掉了两个家丁的手脚？胖家丁被踩的喘气困难，此时见了管家，两眼放光，像是看见了救星呜呜哭，“管家大人，快救救我们……”“放肆，来人，将九夫人给我抓起来！”官家连城峰大手一扬，就有十名家丁上前，气势汹汹的拔剑而出。该死，凰冷月虽身份高贵，但如见也是卑贱的小妾而已，可这两名家丁是魅主子眼前的红人！更何况凰冷月还是个远近闻名的废材软蛋！凰冷月挑眉，真是人善被人欺，没有能力就连狗奴才都可以往她头上爬。如果换成从前的凰冷月也许就只能任由欺负了。可，她是谁？她可是尊凰女皇！“想抓我？！来啊！”凰冷月勾勾手指，眼底都是轻蔑。众家丁信心满怀冲上前，他们没有什么可怕的，凰冷月是什么材料，那是一个打死都不会放光的货色！任人践踏，他们任何人都可以欺到她头上。凰冷月嘴角邪扬，一个漂亮的后空翻，双脚稳稳着地，借力使力的一脚踢飞两名壮汉。嗖嗖。霎时，两名壮汉如肉箭一样，照着众侍卫劈头盖脸砸来。 “噗！”尖刀穿过两猛汉的心头，血溅三尺。寂静，全场死寂！官家连城峰也算是阅历颇深，可眼前这是什么一种情况，她凰冷月不是一点灵力都没有吗？她哪来的力气，哪来的胆量？他不由开始胆战心惊。“你是个什么东西，敢跟我叫嚣！”凰冷月波澜不惊的眸一一扫过在场的人，最后定格在一身华服的连城峰身上，冷冷道。她好歹也是个主子，哪容得一个奴才爬到头上。连城峰神经一凛，本要反骂，但见凰冷月那阴鸷的眸翻滚着一波波杀气，顿时心头一缩。这个眼神，他……畏惧了。凰冷月明明没有一点灵气的，可绕知这样，他还是不敢再越雷池半步！“九夫人好，请九夫人息怒，连城峰是来给九夫人请安的。”强忍住怒火，连城峰决定先低头。“胡扯，请安用刀请？我看你们是蹬鼻子上脸，嚣张惯了！”说罢，凰冷月以迅雷不及掩耳之势，拔起刺穿大汉心口的剑，朝着连城峰脑袋扔了过去。风起，杀意四起！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fengnitian-shashoukuangfei/4.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 4: Establishing Power The wind blows gently, and the morning light warms the earth infinitely. Huang Leng Yue, a useless person in Prince Ning's palace, climbed up to Mei Guo Gong Lian Cheng Mei. This was breaking news in Xichuan. But before this big news spread, I heard that Meiguo Gongliancheng Mei had gone to the Qinglou to drink at the bridal chamber and stayed all night long. Early in the morning, Lian Chengfeng, the manager of the Liancheng family, came to greet Mrs. Ninth with a proud face. Rather than saying hello, it's more like coming to see a joke. I wonder how that good-for-nothing feels like watching over an empty room on his wedding night. Isn't it so cool? Liancheng Mei had eight wives before, and Huang Lengyue ranked ninth. But when Lian Chengfeng brought all the servants to Fengqing Pavilion, everyone's eyes widened. Look what they saw? They actually saw the legendary good-for-nothing standing in front of the pavilion leisurely and gracefully with two servants under his feet. The two servants were none other than the favored celebrities in front of the Protector. Lian Chengfeng shook his head hard. No, he was not hallucinating. That loser actually removed the hands and feet of two servants? The fat servant was trampled and had difficulty breathing. When he saw the butler, his eyes lit up, as if he had seen a savior and cried, \"Master Butler, please save us...\" \"Br0br, come here, arrest Madam Ninth!\" The official Lian Chengfeng raised his hand, and ten servants stepped forward and drew their swords menacingly. Damn it, although Huang Lengyue has a noble status, she is just a humble concubine, but these two servants are the celebrities in front of Master Mei! What's more, Huang Lengyue is known far and wide as a good-for-nothing coward! Huang Lengyue raised her eyebrows. It was true that a good person was bullied. Even a dog slave could climb on her head if she had no ability. If it were the former Huang Lengyue, she might have no choice but to let herself be bullied. But, who is she? She is the Phoenix Queen! \"You want to arrest me?! Come on!\" Huang Lengyue raised her fingers with contempt in her eyes. The servants rushed forward with confidence. They had nothing to fear. What kind of material was Huang Lengyue? He was someone who would not shine even if he was beaten to death! She was trampled on by anyone, and any one of them could bully her. Huang Lengyue's lips curled up in an evil way, and she performed a beautiful backflip, landed firmly on the ground with her feet, and used her strength to kick the two strong men away. Whoosh. In an instant, two strong men struck at the guards' heads and faces like meat arrows. \"Poof!\" The sharp knife passed through the hearts of the two fierce men, and blood spattered three feet. Silence, the whole place was dead silent! Lian Chengfeng, an official from the official family, is considered to have a lot of experience, but what kind of situation is this? Doesn't she, Huang Lengyue, have no spiritual power at all? Where did she get her strength and courage? He couldn't help but start to feel frightened. \"Who are you? You dare to yell at me!\" Huang Lengyue's calm eyes swept over the people present one by one, and finally settled on Liancheng Feng, who was dressed in gorgeous clothes, and said coldly. She is a master after all, how can she allow a slave to climb over her head. Lian Chengfeng's nerves froze and he was about to retaliate, but when he saw Huang Lengyue's sinister eyes rolling with waves of murderous intent, his heart suddenly shrank. This look made him...frightened. Huang Lengyue obviously didn't have any spiritual energy at all, but knowing this, he still didn't dare to take another step beyond the thunder pool! \"Hello Madam Ninth, please calm down Madam Ninth. Lian Chengfeng is here to pay his respects to Madam Ninth.\" Suppressing his anger, Lian Chengfeng decided to bow his head first. \"Nonsense, do you want me to treat you with a sword? I think you are just kicking your nose in the face, you are used to being arrogant!\" After saying that, Huang Lengyue pulled out the sword that pierced the big man's heart and threw it towards Lian Chengfeng's head. The wind is blowing, murderous intent is everywhere!", "title_en": "Chapter 4"}